&lt;h2 id="introduction"&gt;Introduction&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WWII started on different days for different people. For Africans, 1935 when
Mussolini invaded. For Europeans, Sept 1939 when Hitler invaded Poland. For
Americans, Dec 1941 when Japan attacked Pearl Harbor. For Asians, 1931 when
Japan occupied Manchuria. &lt;span class="citation-ref"&gt;&lt;a href="#Chang1997-Ch0"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;



&lt;div class="comment-holder"&gt;
 &lt;div class="comment" title="Comment: tangential aside"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kenyan schools taught 1939 as the start of WWII.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>